<title>BRAZIL: Brazil sets commercial dlr buy/sell tender.</title>
<headline>Brazil sets commercial dlr buy/sell tender.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Central Bank announced Tuesday an auction in the commercial foreign exchange market requiring buy and sell offers from financial institutions, dealers said.</p>
<p>Before the auction, the real was asked at 1.0532 per dollar and bid at 1.0534, they said.</p>
<p>((--Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo Newsroom, 5511 2485415))</p>
